  "s08": {
    "duration": 38.832,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "多级页表的做法，是把 VPN 再切几刀。",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 36278847
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "切成 k 段，前 k 减一段查到的都是下一级页表的位置。",
        "offset": 36778847,
        "duration": 52644232
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "只有最后一段，查到的才是真正的物理页号。",
        "offset": 89423080,
        "duration": 43750001
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以翻译一次，要查 k 次页表。",
        "offset": 133173081,
        "duration": 29447116
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "这里是用时间换空间。",
        "offset": 162620198,
        "duration": 21995193
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "省在哪？",
        "offset": 184615391,
        "duration": 14903846
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "只有第一级页表必须常驻。",
        "offset": 199519238,
        "duration": 25841347
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "后面几级按需分配，用不到的那一项 valid 为零，就不建下级页表。",
        "offset": 225360585,
        "duration": 56730771
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "典型程序四 GB 空间里大部分是没分配的，这一省就是几个数量级。",
        "offset": 282091356,
        "duration": 56129809
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "代价是访存次数变多，所以后面还需要 TLB。",
        "offset": 338221166,
        "duration": 49519232
      }
    ],
