  "s14": {
    "duration": 37.344,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "内存满了，就得换出一页，选择权在置换算法。",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 46615386
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "常用的有 LRU，最近最少使用，还有时钟算法。",
        "offset": 47115386,
        "duration": 42908655
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "这里有两个位很关键。",
        "offset": 90024041,
        "duration": 19711539
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "修改位 dirty 为一，说明这页被写过，换出前必须写回磁盘。",
        "offset": 109735580,
        "duration": 57091348
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "为零就不用写回，直接丢掉，因为磁盘上还有副本。",
        "offset": 166826929,
        "duration": 48437501
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "访问位 accessed 记录最近有没有被访问，置换算法靠它判断。",
        "offset": 215264430,
        "duration": 55168271
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "被换出的页去哪？",
        "offset": 270432702,
        "duration": 16706731
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "去交换分区，硬盘上专门划出来的一块。",
        "offset": 287139433,
        "duration": 34495193
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以一次缺页，可能包含一次磁盘读，甚至再加一次磁盘写。",
        "offset": 321634627,
        "duration": 51322117
      }
    ],
